          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Nighttime observation of vertical movements of white lights at the top of a hill: lights induced by nighttime maintenance activities on an antenna infrastructure (nighttime painting job on a pole to limit the risk of service interruption).",
